  "instruction": "The risk lane's deployment runner failed attestation and the lane is suspended until the twenty-fourth, stranding the model-runtime patch for the three regional fraud-model pools before the attestation date. The protocol allows one pool per night with drift monitoring in between. Figure out how much session time the three pools need, what is honestly open on the data lane this week once the booked changes, the reconciliation block, the promo freeze, and the nights without a certified fraud secondary are set aside, and when the last pool lands. Move the change to the first session you settle on and leave Bruno a note laying out the rest and any option that would need Tunde.",
